  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The 3M™ Dual Lock Reclosable Fastener simplifies use, offering both durability and convenience. The mushroom-shaped heads allow parts to slide easily into place before securely locking together. Once fastened, the connectors are hidden, leaving a smooth and clean surface."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Product Feature"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Easy to install and remove | Features good temperature resistance of 220°F (104°C) | Best suited for indoor and outdoor use"
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"><br/></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Introduction</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<p>The 3M™ Dual Lock Reclosable Fastener simplifies use, offering both durability and convenience. The mushroom-shaped heads allow parts to slide easily into place before securely locking together. Once fastened, the connectors are hidden, leaving a smooth and clean surface.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc product-specification-table-small-padding\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Product Specification</h2>\n<!-- table布局 -->\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" data-mce-style=\"border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"padding: 10px!important; background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">\n<div>Product ID</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"padding: 10px!important; background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>D (mm)</div>\n<p>Diameter</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"padding: 10px!important; border-color: #ADADAD; text-align: center;\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; border-color: #ADADAD; text-align: center;\">NC002</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"padding: 10px!important; border-color: #ADADAD;\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; border-color: #ADADAD;\">20</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"padding: 10px!important; border-color: #ADADAD; text-align: center;\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; border-color: #ADADAD; text-align: center;\">NC003</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"padding: 10px!important; border-color: #ADADAD;\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; border-color: #ADADAD;\">30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"padding: 10px!important; border-color: #ADADAD; text-align: center;\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; border-color: #ADADAD; text-align: center;\">NC004</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"padding: 10px!important; border-color: #ADADAD;\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; border-color: #ADADAD;\">40</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- table布局 --> <!-- table布局 -->\n<p> </p>\n<!-- 物品清单布局 -->\n</div>\n<!-- table布局 --><!-- 物品清单布局 -->\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-icpc pct_padding-in-mobile .pct_hardware-tableList pct_hardware-tableList-t-icpc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Basic Information</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_icpc pct_grad-2-pc pct_grad-1-mobile pct_hardware-tableList\">\n<!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\">\n<!-- table布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\" data-mce-style=\"padding: 0;\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;\" style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;\">\n<!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Brand Name</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">3M</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Color</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Black</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- table布局 -->\n</div>\n<!-- 第二条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<!-- table布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\" data-mce-style=\"padding: 0;\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 0px; font-weight: bold; height: 76px;\" style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 0px; font-weight: bold; height: 76px;\">\n<!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Shape</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Round</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Quantity</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">4 PCS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- table布局 -->\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 如需添加在此处添加 -->\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 标题加文案结束 -->\n<p> </p>\n<!-- 查看PDF -->\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"><br/></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Product Feature</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Easy to install and remove       |        Features good temperature resistance of 220°F (104°C)       |       Best suited for indoor and outdoor use</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "The 3M™ Dual Lock Reclosable Fastener simplifies use, offering both durability and convenience. The mushroom-shaped heads allow parts to slide easily into place before securely locking together. Once fastened, the connectors are hidden, leaving a smooth and clean surface.\n\nEasy to install and remove | Features good temperature resistance of 220°F (104°C) | Best suited for indoor and outdoor use",
